WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:05.405
(glass breaks)
(guys scream)

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.408
- Eduardo man, you
are so loco, man!

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.212
We need a crazy vato
like you in our gang.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:17.083 align:start size:88% position:13%
With this bandana, I
welcome you to the gang.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:20.720 align:start size:72% position:28%
- Yo, hold up.
- Okay.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.821
- What's going on?

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.424
- Hey, Carlito.

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:28.428
I was just welcoming
Eduardo into the gang.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:29.362
- Why?

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:32.332
Who he, what he did?

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.934
- He's crazy, man.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:38.271
We were thinking that the
gang needs a crazy guy.

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:39.839
- Yeah man, this guy is loco.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.574
Show him, Eduardo.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.014
(glass breaks)

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:51.751 align:start size:75% position:25%
- Wow, loco!
(Eduardo groans)

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.720
That's loco.
- Loco, huh?

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.791
- No, I'm the loco
one in this game.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:58.758
- What?

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.760
- Okay, okay, check this out.

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:07.734
Quack quack quack, I'm a duck.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.936 align:start size:84% position:16%
- No, no, no.
- I'm a crazy duck.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:12.806
- No Carlito, it's not
that kind of loco, okay.

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:16.209
That's more like zany or goofy.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:17.143
- Yeah.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:18.144
- It's the wrong kind of loco.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.679
- You wanna see loco?

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:23.383
- Carlito, you're not crazy.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.318
You're like the quiet one.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:28.755
- I'm not quiet, I never
be caught being quiet.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:33.193 align:start size:88% position:13%
In fact, I'm always
loud, check it. (groans)

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.664
- Okay, okay, that was weird.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.467
Were you yelling?

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:42.735
- I show you loco right here,

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.838
right now in broad daylight, yo.

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:46.840
- Carlito, no Carlito.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.741
- Pull up our pants, homes.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start position:0%
- I got Tilikum on my underwear,
that's the black fish.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.247
I'm naked and I don't even care.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:56.216
- Carlito, you gotta
pull 'em up, okay?

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:58.885
There's like children in
this neighborhood, okay?

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.186
- Okay, but check this out.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:03.556
I got nine punch cards
from Fro-Yo Universe,

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.592
each with one stamp in it.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:08.828
Every time I get a fro
yo, I get a new card.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:11.564
- Carlito, that's just being
cavalier with your finances

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.233
instead of collecting
your free dessert.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.968
I mean, that's not loco,

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:17.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's just like
financially irresponsible.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:21.307
- I might not be loco,
but you know who is loco?

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:24.144
My friend, Mr. Basurahead.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.047
- Just dumping garbage.

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:29.549
- Hi, I'm the most
loco person in here.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.119 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Carlito, why
would you do that?

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:34.154
- Okay.

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:34.988
- Carlito.

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:40.460
Okay, Carlito, you don't
have to do this, okay?

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.163 align:start size:88% position:13%
It's not necessary,
you're not the loco one.

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.731
- Check this out.

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:47.634
(bottle thuds on head)

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:51.137
Yeah, I'm crazy,
I'm the loco one.

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:52.605
(groans)

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.641
- Carlito, please
don't do it again.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:56.976
Carlito, stop.

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.478
- I'm in too deep.

00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:00.046 align:start position:0%
- This is like watching the
British version of "The Office"

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:02.949 align:start size:97% position:3%
like it's funny, but awkward
and sad at the same time.

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:03.783
- Yes.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:06.119
- Oh!
- Well,

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:09.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I just proved this
bottle is unbreakable.

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:10.490
(glass shatters)

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.926 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Carlito, you're
embarrassing yourself.

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.661
- Look at this, you
know, what's loco?

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.663
- No, no, no Carlito, what
are you gonna do with that?

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:20.567
- I don't know, I'm
too crazy.(groans)

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:24.304 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Carlito, why would
you do that, man?

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:27.707
That was loco, but not
in an entertaining way.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:28.508
- Okay.

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:33.379
- Carlito, put down the gun!

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:37.550
- Oh don't you fear, the
crazy, crazy one is here.

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:40.119
- Carlito, stop!

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.288
Don't toss the gun
around, Carlito.

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:43.489
- [Gang Member] Put
the gun down Carlito!

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:44.824
- Shouldn't have done that.

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:46.326
- Stop twirling it!

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:48.828
- Loco, loco, loco, where
does it stop, nobody knows.

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:52.899
(gun fires)

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:57.604
- (bleep) Carlito, you just
shot Eduardo in the head!

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.743
- Now I'm the most
loco in the gang?

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:06.846 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yes Carlito, by
process of elimination,

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:09.716
you are the most loco
person in the gang.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:10.550
- Yes.

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:15.688
(guys scream)

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.793 align:start size:84% position:16%
- He caught the
bullet in his teeth!

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.762
That's the most locoest
thing I've ever seen.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:26.165 align:start size:84% position:16%
No, no, no Carlito.
(gun fires)

